From 180db83c93533a61d74427a03dcf56ef7d01973e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:42:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] DM calls: WebRTC voice/video calls with screen share
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- call_signals table carries SDP offers/answers and ICE candidates over
  Realtime, RLS-limited to the two parties (media is browser-to-browser)
- src/lib/call.ts: call manager singleton — offer/answer flow, candidate
  queueing before the peer connection exists (ringing phase), 45s ring
  timeout, busy auto-decline, mic/camera toggles, screen share by
  replacing the camera track (no renegotiation)
- CallOverlay mounted globally in AppShell: rings on every page, incoming
  accept/decline UI, live video with local PiP, duration timer, WebAudio
  ringer, end-of-call notices
- messages header gets voice + video call buttons (hidden for samples)
- i18n: call.* keys for en / ar / fr

SQL to run in the Supabase SQL editor: supabase/migrations/20261102000006_call_signals.sql
